	(text "PMC (Power, Monitoring and Control) motherboard for NILE and other CPSS test stands.\nFeaturing 16x SPI Channels using DVEC, 4x PWM, 2x General Purpose ADC capable GPIO,\n3x 2A power switches/outputs and also of course 24x 100mA solenoid drivers over DSUB.\n\nThere is an on board RP2040 for controlling the solenoids and also a Raspberry PI GPIO\ninterface over IDC 40 Pin for compute & control. Along with mounting holes to have this \nboard be a Raspberry PI carrier board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 173.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "89588636-c43a-45a2-9cfd-fd1291cd28df")
	)
